  "assets": [
    {
      "order": 1,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/6c565b5d-8ca6-498a-a138-f666d01d7966.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "然而， 这种平静与个股层面的剧烈分化形成鲜明反差。 过去一个月，标普500指数仅移动0.8%，而成分股平均波动幅度高达8.9%，两者之差达8.1个百分点，位于过去30年的第95百分位。AMD单月涨幅达39.5%，英特尔上涨27.6%；而奈飞下跌18.2%，银行股同样承压。",
      "path": "assets/figure_001.png",
      "sha256": "7963a01424af9e944e0384f338cb14b20e6a678c97cee63ed6844ab0b871336d",
      "bytes": 325725,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 527,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/6c565b5d-8ca6-498a-a138-f666d01d7966.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/a32cede6-f740-47b5-ac47-c597f49ec233.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "从更宏观的视角看，成分股的损伤触目惊心：",
      "path": "assets/figure_002.png",
      "sha256": "89d5c2974d87c50c8ae940811faf6171c8e90ba614bc4db108e21ed174cf0877",
      "bytes": 632456,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 633,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/a32cede6-f740-47b5-ac47-c597f49ec233.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/843f4e25-a4b0-4a23-b05a-660b5dfb8294.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "换言之， 指数距历史高点仅一步之遥，但六分之一的成分股已腰斩。 McElligott将此定性为\"滚动式大幅修正\"，并批评那些认为\"股市没有反映利率风险\"的观点—— 利率敏感型板块过去一个半月已遭到重创： 医疗保健-3.5%，非必需消费品-3.6%，公用事业-4.6%，工业-5.8%，金融-7.7%，材料-7.9%，REITs -9.8%。过去30天内，标普500中仅有科技、媒体、电信（TMT）和能源两个板块录得正收益。",
      "path": "assets/figure_003.png",
      "sha256": "4b14391b481cc074bc5fbf51efbca4b121c844fc613e00afe93e1cbf75c18b9d",
      "bytes": 584246,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 2003,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/843f4e25-a4b0-4a23-b05a-660b5dfb8294.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/c7fe4571-712f-462e-ae20-6e8ba1039acf.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "自8月3日以来，\"Mag 7\"（七大科技巨头）上涨7.7%，标普500上涨2.6%，而等权重标普500则下跌3%。",
      "path": "assets/figure_004.png",
      "sha256": "0ff44bc81ba61815ab64581c2e8bb83d267de7f7f1f13f4f28b04c7119f09354",
      "bytes": 180782,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 421,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/c7fe4571-712f-462e-ae20-6e8ba1039acf.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/b7e562a3-c78d-4cc6-9682-2a1eac6711a2.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "McElligott将这一现象定义为\"主题性分化\"（Thematic Bifurcation）：",
      "path": "assets/figure_005.png",
      "sha256": "e2ccf35a73dbfffd4e4fc85045f218c8813630069cdb9cee8317dc080e998be0",
      "bytes": 438481,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 512,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/b7e562a3-c78d-4cc6-9682-2a1eac6711a2.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/884aa1e5-141c-4816-9503-47a5a3cd0be7.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "据彭博报道，高盛衍生品策略师Brian Garrett此前指出，过去25年中仅有两个时期出现过如此低的已实现相关性——分别是全球金融危机前夕和Volmageddon。",
      "path": "assets/figure_006.png",
      "sha256": "ce4ec1372a6a819e3f08554ed370cf78b81dfb897f4b79622bc899c62f200005",
      "bytes": 240330,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 275,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/884aa1e5-141c-4816-9503-47a5a3cd0be7.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/0d62afc1-1e24-45e4-9ee8-de7e65b3b16c.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "卖出波动率的回报之丰厚令人咋舌： 卖出日度25-delta标普认沽期权的10日夏普比率高达13.9，卖出日度宽跨式组合的夏普比率达14.2。",
      "path": "assets/figure_007.png",
      "sha256": "d2094d425d3bbae4beca0dc87d4300da0e004bfbb72823545a21f941c2aba12f",
      "bytes": 577134,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 669,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/0d62afc1-1e24-45e4-9ee8-de7e65b3b16c.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/ffdf6aad-6106-41f2-bcb0-8341618d6204.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "除QIS策略外，衍生品收益基金的规模同样不可忽视。 衍生品/收益基金资产管理规模目前达3220亿美元，自2020年以来增加2220亿美元，基金与结构性产品合计每月提供的Vega供给达4.15亿Vega。",
      "path": "assets/figure_008.png",
      "sha256": "7d8c556ba5e3bf0e9fdb6288d0db9737639a8c1ca85aae53cf4bce7393d29020",
      "bytes": 554246,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 624,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/ffdf6aad-6106-41f2-bcb0-8341618d6204.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/e8edfc35-e125-46a3-bb11-dccf59182be0.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "低实现波动率形成自我强化循环： 波动率控制策略、CTA和风险平价基金的美股敞口已回升至第86百分位，接近年内高点。",
      "path": "assets/figure_009.png",
      "sha256": "82e6f0fc952138226e4c806ffcc0b3b7b468fb63a462db40fd683e73f574b118",
      "bytes": 466136,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 1266,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/e8edfc35-e125-46a3-bb11-dccf59182be0.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/c5dc77c0-9972-492d-a7ec-1cf93d54108e.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "最为反常的是期权偏斜结构： 认沽偏斜处于过去一年的第0.4百分位，而认购偏斜则高达第99.6百分位（野村图表显示为第100百分位）。 市场参与者几乎不购买下行保护，“唯一的恐惧是右尾上涨风险”—— 大量机构投资者因持仓不足AI核心股票而面临踏空压力，被迫追涨的潜在动能持续积聚。",
      "path": "assets/figure_010.png",
      "sha256": "a5208548fae19b1816dd93362dc80e2090273c1cca90cfa063a4cb5402df2b7f",
      "bytes": 242167,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 577,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/c5dc77c0-9972-492d-a7ec-1cf93d54108e.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/06540387-5fac-4d24-afa2-00bab635791b.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "McElligott将能源——尤其是欧洲柴油短缺——定性为整个市场结构中最脆弱的环节。 他的核心判断是：柴油裂解价差（Cracks）= 利率波动率。",
      "path": "assets/figure_011.png",
      "sha256": "8390e43a51ac69a1b6431270cc34d4c0661b8bcf0b1bb842a7e3340d8c3f7f8c",
      "bytes": 231809,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 471,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/06540387-5fac-4d24-afa2-00bab635791b.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/4d9b86e3-c6e6-44cf-92f7-36256c1b7a81.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "欧洲能源市场同样处于年内高位： 德国1年期远期基础电价138，荷兰天然气近79，英国天然气196，柴油价格1485美元。",
      "path": "assets/figure_012.png",
      "sha256": "3779f44763a042d346726d938ce371ac7f3c215b0dff3fc8ba79b4175098e920",
      "bytes": 1066785,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 660,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/4d9b86e3-c6e6-44cf-92f7-36256c1b7a81.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/7772677e-7a7e-451c-a045-59f9f442f558.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "McElligott警告，即便伊朗局势暂时缓和，炼油产能的结构性短缺依然存在，\"无论多少条Truth Social帖子，都无法炼出一桶柴油\"。",
      "path": "assets/figure_013.png",
      "sha256": "726685098beb7742e0350191233cf2118ac6fdf14bd74d69385779cbbb1a522e",
      "bytes": 1004684,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 659,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/7772677e-7a7e-451c-a045-59f9f442f558.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/3db2b1d0-749c-45c3-815b-b50ffb9a7927.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "就在McElligott报告发布当日， 两大关键事件相继验证了其分析框架。 特朗普在Truth Social宣布中期选举前不对伊朗动武，油价随即下跌，印证了McElligott所描述的\"和解\"情景。",
      "path": "assets/figure_014.png",
      "sha256": "a5cac14fce87de6bdd7a6869c35bc75d7dcc2d4eafdae3094a4983ea71703829",
      "bytes": 357756,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 637,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/3db2b1d0-749c-45c3-815b-b50ffb9a7927.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/4936707f-7894-48ee-95b3-1e499ea842e9.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "然而更具冲击力的是，据英国《金融时报》报道，OpenAI年化营收约为200亿美元，远低于此前向投资者传递的约700亿美元预期，差距高达约500亿美元。 消息公布后，纳斯达克当日跌逾1%，AI板块遭到集中抛售。",
      "path": "assets/figure_015.png",
      "sha256": "b456eaa0dcc136fcdc59b58968319e83acb3047930ca7cbedd122c020b375aaf",
      "bytes": 27802,
      "width": 487,
      "height": 243,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/4936707f-7894-48ee-95b3-1e499ea842e9.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/948f34c3-091c-440a-a26a-8af10706d8e3.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "但这一逻辑链条的起点，正是AI需求的真实性，而这一前提刚刚遭遇了来自OpenAI自身投资者文件的首次重大冲击。",
      "path": "assets/figure_016.png",
      "sha256": "c5ba1f2645ffef69833835f9e1060bb19038b872d6068a4a5e0886968bf7f143",
      "bytes": 183812,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 463,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/948f34c3-091c-440a-a26a-8af10706d8e3.png"
    }
